Output scene-receipt.mp4
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Padding 24
Hide
Type "cd /repo/packages/receipts && export NO_COLOR=" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "node verify-receipt.mjs   # trust nobody, verify"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
Sleep 4s
